{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After finding herself in a dark room Diti tries to find what happened at this place by going through someone else\u2019s past experiences.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take a journey though all the supposed fears which may or may not be your own.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather answers regarding incidents that took place which were deemed inhuman or even supernatural.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a new story as it begins to unfold in this first of many psychological horror installments.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Full Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High end raytraced graphics</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intriguing story rich experience (All seven working days)</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Voices in Hindi language (All text in English)</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > In-game cutscenes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sanity system called State of Mind</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive in-world menu system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minimum to no Heads-up display</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each day can be replayed from the dedicated menu</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4035450?t=1759023606","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4035450/f137fb98bb670f39acb34c219f03ed89c9a67655/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759023606","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4035450/ca8f3b5668c16e0bbb768a6b9591268ed54326c8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759023606","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4035450/ca8f3b5668c16e0bbb768a6b9591268ed54326c8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759023606","categories":[{"description":"Single-pl